rong until you do it."}]},{"id":"blk-53268","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-101728","text":"What is already ruled — do not relitigate"}]},{"id":"blk-53269","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-101729","text":"Every brief repeats the ones it needs, but the whole set:"}]},{"id":"blk-53270","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-53272","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-101730","marks":["bold"],"text":"Cloudflare for everything; Fly for Keycloak alone."},{"id":"spn-101731","text":" Workers are V8 isolates and cannot run"}]}],"id":"blk-53271","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-53273","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-101732","text":"Java — the mirror of Firecracker being unable to boot FreeBSD."}]},{"id":"blk-53274","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-53276","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-101733","marks":["bold"],"text":"Hetzner for the VM."},{"id":"spn-101734","text":" T&R and Pigsty both need a real machine."}]}],"id":"blk-53275","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-53278","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-101735","marks":["bold"],"text":"PlanetScale PS-5 HA ($15/mo) for Keycloak's database."},{"id":"spn-101736","text":" Not Fly Managed Postgres ($38)."}]}],"id":"blk-53277","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-53280","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-101737","marks":["bold"],"text":"R2 for bulk objects"},{"id":"spn-101738","text":" — zero egress is what makes the restore claim true."}]}],"id":"blk-53279","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-53282","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-101739","marks":["bold"],"text":"Compute moves into the OS."},{"id":"spn-101740","text":" The ten Fly apps are being wound down, but **nothing is torn down"}]}],"id":"blk-53281","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-53283","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-101741","text":"before its OS-side replacement is "},{"id":"spn-101742","marks":["code"],"text":"live_local"},{"id":"spn-101743","